# STO-83: response headers for the web companion (Cloudflare static assets). Ignored by the
# native apps. A Content-Security-Policy waits for the final web/API domains (see
# docs/web-companion.md): it has to name the API origin in connect-src and img-src.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self), microphone=(), geolocation=()
